# S2a — context, after Amendment 1 (A1). Campaign 1.
#
# (context.Context).Value was removed: it is an INTERFACE method, so the call
# is invoke-mode, StaticCallee() is nil, costtable.CalleeKey never yields a key
# and the assumption path is unreachable. Measured on a fixture that literally
# calls ctx.Value, not inferred. Note the asymmetry worth remembering: a
# //bigo:cost directive ON an interface method declaration IS honored (via
# methodCosts), so the directive path can express something an assumption file
# cannot.
context.WithValue O(1)
